pet|animal|NOUN|Companion animal|An animal kept and cared for mainly for companionship.|thú cưng|Their pet sleeps beside the sofa.|Thú cưng của họ ngủ cạnh ghế sofa.|Countable.|0
pop|music-noun|NOUN|Popular music|Popular music with a broad audience and often memorable melodies.|nhạc pop|She listens to pop on her journey home.|Cô ấy nghe nhạc pop trên đường về nhà.|Uncountable music genre.|0
pop|music-adjective|ADJECTIVE|Relating to pop music|Connected with pop music.|thuộc nhạc pop|The pop singer released a new album.|Ca sĩ nhạc pop phát hành album mới.|Attributive; pop music or singer.|1
pop|burst|VERB|Make a sudden short sound|To burst or make a sudden short explosive sound.|nổ; phát tiếng bốp|The balloon popped beside the window.|Quả bóng nổ bốp cạnh cửa sổ.|Transitive or intransitive.|2
pop|visit|VERB|Visit briefly|To go somewhere for a short time, informally.|ghé qua|I'll pop into the shop after work.|Tôi sẽ ghé cửa hàng sau giờ làm.|Pop into, in, over; informal.|3
parade|procession|NOUN|Public procession|A public procession of people or vehicles, often for celebration.|cuộc diễu hành|The parade moved slowly through the square.|Đoàn diễu hành chậm rãi đi qua quảng trường.|Countable.|0
probability|likelihood|NOUN|Likelihood|How likely an event is to happen.|khả năng xảy ra; xác suất|The forecast shows a high probability of rain.|Dự báo cho thấy khả năng mưa cao.|Probability of; no numerical guarantee.|0
rating|assessment|NOUN|Assessment level|A score or level indicating quality, popularity, or another measured feature.|mức đánh giá; xếp hạng|The hotel received a high customer rating.|Khách sạn nhận mức đánh giá cao từ khách hàng.|Countable; rating for a feature.|0
